Backport of llvm/llvm-project#200303, "[Driver] Don't warn on ObjC constant-literal flags for non-ObjC inputs" (merged 2026-06-05), to
swiftlang/llvm-project swift-6.4.0-RELEASE (docs/adr/0170-xcodes-clang-abi-and-a-patched-clang.md, B-170).
Adapted: Options.td at clang/include/clang/Driver/Options.td.

